RULE_VERSION: 1.0
RULE_NAME: PERSONAL_AI_ASSISTANT
APP_TYPE: AI_ASSISTANT
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: A personal AI assistant with real conversations and persistent history.

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Chat
- Conversation history
- Provider selection
- Error handling
- Persistent data
EXECUTION:
  MAX_CYCLES: 8
  MAX_TASKS: 16
  MAX_RETRIES_PER_TASK: 1
  AUTO_APPLY: true
  VERIFY_EACH_TASK: true
  STOP_ON_USER_ACTION: true

DEFINITION_OF_DONE:
- Chat works with a configured provider
- Conversation history persists after restart
- Provider errors are handled clearly
- SoloHost runtime starts successfully
